# Data Dictionary

| Column | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| Year | Financial year of the transaction |
| Booking Months | Month in which the sales order was booked |
| Delivery Months | Month in which the order was delivered |
| Month NO. | Numeric representation of the booking month |
| Months | Sequential month number within the financial year |
| Customer P.O | Customer purchase order reference |
| Consignee Name | Customer or consignee receiving the goods |
| Products | Product name |
| Category | Product classification (e.g., GSL, POM) |
| Quantity | Number of units sold |
| Rate | Selling price per unit (GBP) |
| Net Value | Sales value before VAT |
| VAT @ 20% | VAT charged on the transaction |
| Gross Amt | Total invoice amount including VAT |
| BATCH NO | Manufacturing batch number |
| Transfer Price | Internal transfer price per unit |
| COGS | Cost of Goods Sold |
| Gross Margin in GBP | Profit earned in GBP |
| Gross Margin % | Profit margin percentage |
| Retro | Retro discount or rebate, if applicable |
